# The Profiler panel on examples/43-ambush while it plays (ADR 0210): opened
# from the command palette before the game starts -- the palette is the
# editor's, and a running game has the keyboard -- made taller, both switches
# put on, a frame chosen on the strip, and each tab looked at.
# Coordinates are a 1600 by 900 frame's.
wait 60
key ctrl+shift+p
wait 8
text Profiler
wait 8
key enter
wait 20
drag 700 607 700 330
wait 10
click 781 41
move 700 200
wait 60
click 299 373
click 463 373
move 700 200
wait 240
click 1000 440
wait 6
move 700 200
wait 4
shot profiler-frame
click 151 506
wait 6
shot profiler-scripts
click 206 506
wait 6
shot profiler-gpu
click 264 506
wait 6
shot profiler-memory
click 165 373
wait 4
click 85 506
move 700 200
wait 6
shot profiler-worst
quit
